{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:202fc41cf6cdde41","name":"Infiltration Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-202fc41cf6cdde41","title":"Infiltration Talent Tree","revision":19491,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:04:09Z","sha256":"cab94ddcd7b62a7c9995409bdb8b3af41077c13db678f09f3e181e4c2f8aebb1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19491","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Infiltration%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-202fc41cf6cdde41","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained to secretly infiltrate enemy strongholds and organizations by force or by guile.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Always Ready"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are accustomed to operating in response to enemy actions. When your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Readied Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Readied_Action"}," is triggered, it does not change your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Count"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Count"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Concealed Weapon Expert"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are deadly with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," strike, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hold-Out Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hold-Out_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:99ddc9f0285574f3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knife"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knife","referenceId":"reference:846e26d154ced41e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibrodagger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibrodagger","referenceId":"reference:18c30472775a5a3b"},", or other small concealable weapons (as determined by the Gamemaster). Once per round you can use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to reroll an attack using one of these weapons, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Creeping Approach"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate a single opponent within 12 squares that is unaware of you as the target of this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, that target may not make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks to notice you, even if you enter the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". If you or any of your allies attack the target, the effect of this Talent ends.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Set for Stun"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are particularly adept with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," weapons. If you are using a ranged weapon that deals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage (including a lethal weapon set to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"},"), you can spend two consecutive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," in the same round to activate this Talent. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage on your next attack exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", you move the target -3 steps along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", instead of the normal -2 steps.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Silent Takedown"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at quietly knocking out or eliminating guards and others when they are caught unaware. If you damage an opponent that is unaware of you, that opponent cannot speak or make other noises until the end of your next turn. This is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
